Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. RapidOcrNet 4.2.0
   Use: pure-C# OCR inference wrapper around ONNX Runtime (detection, text
        recognition, angle classification).
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Source: https://github.com/BobLd/RapidOcrNet

2. ONNX Runtime
   Use: cross-platform inference engine that executes the OCR models.
   License: MIT License
   Source: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime

3. PaddleOCR PP-OCRv5 / PP-OCRv4 text detection, recognition and
   classification models (ch_PP-OCRv5_det_mobile, ch_PP-OCRv5_rec_mobile,
   ch_ppocr_mobile_v2.0_cls) plus the ppocrv5 dictionary
   Use: the bundled Chinese OCR models under models/v5 (≈21 MB).
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Source: https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR
   Redistributed via: RapidAI/RapidOCR v3.9.2 (https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR)
   The bundled copies are byte-identical to the upstream release; all four
   SHA256 hashes (det / rec / cls / dict) are pinned and verified in
   build/fetch-models.ps1.

4. Microsoft Visual C++ v14 redistributable runtime DLLs
   (vcruntime140.dll, vcruntime140_1.dll, msvcp140.dll, msvcp140_1.dll)
   Use: app-local runtime required by onnxruntime.dll on machines that do not
        have the Visual C++ Redistributable installed.
   License: Microsoft Software License Terms for the Microsoft Visual C++
            Redistributable (redistributable components).
   See runtime/vcredist-x64/PROVENANCE.txt for provenance and hashes.

5. YamlDotNet 18.1.0
   Use: parsing the table-profile YAML files under Profiles/.
   License: MIT License
   Source: https://github.com/aaubry/YamlDotNet

6. SkiaSharp 3.119.1
   Use: image handling required by RapidOcrNet.
   License: MIT License
   Source: https://github.com/mono/SkiaSharp

7. Clipper2 2.0.0
   Use: polygon clipping, a transitive dependency of RapidOcrNet.
   License: Boost Software License 1.0 (BSL-1.0)
   Source: https://github.com/AngusJohnson/Clipper2

8. Other transitive Microsoft packages (System.Numerics.Tensors and similar
   .NET runtime components)
   License: MIT License

